%h2 Integration with the Ticketing System
%p This section provides guidance on how to configure and manage the integration with the ticketing system.
%h3 Configuration Options
%p Tickets are assigned to the current default assignee. This can be managed through the ticket configuration selection in the admin dashboard.
%h3 Managing Tickets
%p A ticket is automatically created and associated with a dataset when a review is requested. Changes to a dataset in pre-publication review trigger a comment in the associated ticket, and curators are notified accordingly.
%p On the landing page for each dataset, curators can navigate to ticket integration details by clicking on the "Ticket" link in the curator options bar.
%p From there, they can view ticket details or associate a ticket with a dataset, but any additional comments should be made in the ticketing system itself.
